										"current_level": 5
									},
									"local_notes": "Chassis strength for a size +1 frame, taking ST from 20 to 25 for both striking and lifting. Eclipse Phase records bulk in Durability rather than SOM, so a direct aptitude conversion leaves large morphs at human strength. Priced with the Size limitation (B15) at -10% per point of Size Modifier. HP is unaffected and stays on the Durability rule."
