							"local_notes": "Sets this morph to its chargen price: 45 EP CP / 4 = 12 points. Package value 708, adjustment -696. The package total says what the body is; the chargen price is all you pay for it, and only at creation (Part III)."
						}
					],
					"calc": {
						"points": 12
					},
					"local_notes": "Multipurpose smart-spider chassis (EP 1e, 45 CP / 12 pts at chargen). ST 25, DX +2, HT 12, HP 20, ten limbs, leaps, skates on mini-wheels, flies in zero g. No customization slot - canon gives it none."
