									"calc": {
										"points": 173,
										"current_level": 36
									},
									"local_notes": "Chassis strength for a size +4 frame, taking ST from 14 to 50 for both striking and lifting. Eclipse Phase records bulk in Durability rather than SOM, so a direct aptitude conversion leaves large morphs at human strength. Priced with the Size limitation (B15) at -10% per point of Size Modifier. HP is unaffected and stays on the Durability rule."
								}
