											"local_notes": "Military armor over the standard chassis; stacks with the Synthmorph meta-trait's DR 4 for DR 12 total. DR rescaled to Ultra-Tech bands: Eclipse Phase armor values are compressed and the gear in this project is native Ultra-Tech, so morph armor is mapped onto the same scale as worn armor rather than scaled down. Rigid plate: no flexibility limitation."
