											"name": "Unliving",
											"reference": "B61",
											"local_notes": "Altered wound modifiers: imp & pi++ are x1, pi+ is x1/2, pi is x1/3, pi- is x1/5",
											"cost_adj": "20",
											"disabled": true
										}
									],
									"calc": {
										"points": 100
									},
									"local_notes": "Hundreds of insect-sized microdrones: Injury Tolerance (Diffuse - weapons do max 1-2 damage per attack); can disperse, flow through gaps, crawl/hop/fly at Move 4. As a unit it cannot grab, lift, or wield; individual bugs can interface with electronics. Effectively No Manipulators for physical tasks."
								},
